#: ../../tools/archs4_tools.rst:32 1516497c989d446192c7153689865e43
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get genes most co-expressed with a query gene from "
"ARCHS4, based on Pearson correlation computed across 300K+ uniformly "
"processed RNA-seq samples. Returns the top N most correlated genes with "
"their Pearson correlation coefficients. Useful for identifying "
"functionally related genes, predicting gene function, and building co-"
"expression networks."
msgstr ""

