#: ../../tools/archs4_tools.rst:66 440070d13b114e0eb7e9944f387e7888
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get gene expression levels across human or mouse tissues"
" and cell lines from ARCHS4 (All RNA-seq and ChIP-seq Sample and "
"Signature Search). Returns box-plot statistics (min, Q1, median, Q3, max)"
" in log2(TPM+1) units for each tissue/cell line, computed from 300K+ "
"uniformly processed RNA-seq samples. Choose type='tissue' for "
"organ/tissue expression or type='cellline' for cell line expression. "
"Results are sorted by median expression (highest first)."
msgstr ""

